~ titanic_intro


CrewMember: Welcome aboard the RMS Titanic.

CrewMember: The Titanic was the largest passenger ship in the world when it launched in 1912.

CrewMember: It was built by the White Star Line and designed to be one of the most luxurious ships ever created.

- How big was the Titanic?
    CrewMember: The Titanic was about 882 feet long and could carry over 2,200 passengers and crew.
    => fact2

- Was it considered safe?
    CrewMember: Many people believed the Titanic was extremely safe because of its watertight compartments.
    => fact2


~ fact2
CrewMember: The Titanic began its first voyage from Southampton, England, heading to New York City.

CrewMember: The captain of the ship was Edward J. Smith, a very experienced sea captain.

- What should I do here?
    CrewMember: You should explore the ship and speak with Captain Edward Smith.
    => quest

- Where can I find the captain?
    CrewMember: The captain is somewhere aboard the ship. Try exploring the decks.
    => quest


~ quest
CrewMember: Task Started: Explore the Titanic and speak with Captain Edward Smith to learn more about the ship.



=> END
